an style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">3.DS设置</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>非对策刀：1.阿罗汉 &nbsp;2.水丹丹 3.伪娘</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>对策刀：1.鲁邦 &nbsp;2.水丹丹 3.伪娘</span><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">4.队长设置</p></div><br></div><div>水丹丹优选，对策，阿罗汉也可以</div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><br></div><div data-col=\"6\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"71246\" data-insertcount=\"0\" data-select=\"[]\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 598px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 102px;\"><col style=\"width: 106px;\"><col style=\"width: 108px;\"><col style=\"width: 112px;\"><col style=\"width: 108px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 89px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">阵容1</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"><img style=\"object-fit: contain; width: 78px; height: 78px; display: block; margin: auto;\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636622891393_49047900.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636622891393_49047900.png\"></div></td><td clas